    testing:
      name: Testing & diagnostics
      icon: mdi:test-tube
      collapsed: true
      description: >
        Automatic is scheduler control, not an event: it chooses Normal/default, weather, a season, a
        holiday, or a custom event according to the configured rules. To test, select a TEST option,
        Save, then click Run actions once; saving alone does not run the test. Startup only runs power
        and boot-delay steps. Selected event only assumes WLED is already powered and available.
        Startup + selected event tests the complete sequence. Shutdown only cleans up after a test.
        Tests do not update the scheduler memory helper, so if a test turns devices on outside the
        scheduled window, run Shutdown only before returning to Automatic. Automatic scheduling
        pauses while a test is armed.
      input:
        test_mode:
          name: Test mode
          description: >
            Normal use: select Automatic — Normal scheduler operation and Save. Automatic chooses the
            winning event; Normal/default is only its fallback event. For testing, select a TEST
            option, Save, then click Run actions once. If the test powered devices outside their
            schedule, run TEST — Shutdown actions only before returning this setting to Automatic and
            saving again.
          default: auto
          selector:
            select:
              options:
                - label: Automatic — Normal scheduler operation
                  value: auto
                - label: TEST — Startup actions only
                  value: startup_only
                - label: TEST — Selected event only
                  value: event_only
                - label: TEST — Startup + selected event
                  value: startup_event
                - label: TEST — Shutdown actions only
                  value: shutdown_only
        test_event:
          name: Event to test
          description: >
            Select which event action list should run during an event test. Nothing is selected by
            default, so a holiday or custom event cannot run accidentally. Choose Normal/default to
            test ordinary nights, or choose any weather, season, holiday, or custom event.
          default: none
          selector:
            select:
              options:
                - label: Choose an event to test…
                  value: none
                - label: Normal/default
                  value: normal
                - label: Rain
